Grizelda is a middle-aged female [[Bestiary/Visitors from Beyond#Orc|Orc]]. She managed a small trading caravan that travelled between [[Geography/Althane/Salores/index|Salores]] and the small mining towns in the [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/index|badlands]].

At a rest-stop taken during her final trip, a Khulakahn ambushed her caravan, killing her three compatriots[^1]. She gave up the trade after the incident.

[^1]: Harvey Hemmingwright, Aenne Mont Rey, and Tellulah
